#: includes/class-real-accessability-admin.php:194
msgid ""
"Real Accessibility 2.0 is ready. Set the brand color and the button "
"position, and choose whether to show the plugin credit."
msgstr ""
"Real Accessibility 2.0 is klaar. Stel de merkkleur en de positie van de knop"
" in, en kies of de pluginvermelding wordt getoond."

#: includes/class-real-accessability-admin.php:195
msgid "Open Real Accessibility"
msgstr "Real Accessibility openen"

#: includes/class-real-accessability-admin.php:206
msgid ""
"Show a small credit with a link to the plugin page on WordPress.org at the "
"bottom of the accessibility menu? It helps keep the plugin free."
msgstr ""
"Een kleine vermelding met een link naar de pluginpagina op WordPress.org "
"onderaan het toegankelijkheidsmenu tonen? Zo help je de plugin gratis te "
"houden."

#: includes/class-real-accessability-admin.php:207
